title: Payers › Rules & Instructions › Add or archive a rule
route: /payers/summit?tab=rules
intro: Every group has 'Add a rule'. A rule a person adds is not verified: it starts Unverified, with a source that says who entered it, and only 'Mark as verified' changes that. Archiving marks a rule Superseded: it stops applying, stays in the list struck through, and a workflow that points at it shows a warning until another rule is chosen. A rule read through from the payer's saved rules cannot be archived (edit it instead).
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Open a group, click 'Add a rule'\nat the foot of the group"
overlay dr "Add a rule (right-hand panel)\n'It starts Unverified.'\nThe group's structured values are all offered"
input i1 "Type the title (required) and what it says"
input i2 "Fill the structured values and the instructions"
input i3 "Open 'Applies to and dates' if needed\nServices, request types, dates, product"
click ca "Click 'Add rule'"
decision d1 "Is the title empty?"
toast e1 "'Add a title.'"
overlay rm "Add this rule?\n'It is added Unverified. Workflows send it to manual review\nuntil a person marks it verified with a source.'"
input ir "Type 'Reason for the edit' (required)"
click cs "Click 'Save and log the edit'"
store st "Rule saved in the library\nUnverified, 'Entered by Jordan Perez' as source, version 1, you as owner"
store lg "Edit audit gets a 'Rules' line with the reason"
screen out "New row in the group, Unverified\nThe group count and summary go up"

start s2 "Open a rule row, click 'Archive'"
decision dp "Is it a rule read through from the payer's saved rules?"
process nb "No Archive button on that row\nEdit it to change what it says"
overlay am "Archive the rule?\n'It is marked Superseded and stops applying.\nWorkflows that point at it will show a warning until you pick another rule.\nIt stays in the edit audit.'"
input ar "Type 'Reason for the edit' (required)"
click ac "Click 'Archive and log the edit'"
store as "Rule is Superseded, effective until today\nShown struck through at the foot of the group\nNot counted in the group's summary"
process wr "A workflow step that names it\nshows a warning in its checks\nand cannot be published until another rule is chosen"
store lg2 "Edit audit gets a 'Rules' line"
click cx "Click 'Cancel', the X or press Escape"
endx x1 "Pop-up closes\nNothing changed"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Rules & Instructions › Mark a rule as verified"
goto g2 "Continues in: Payers › Workflow Builder › Check a workflow before publishing"

s1 --> dr --> i1 --> i2 --> i3 --> ca --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| e1 --> i1
d1 -->|No| rm --> ir --> cs --> st --> lg --> out --> g1
dr --> cx --> x1
rm --> cx
s2 --> dp
dp -->|Yes| nb
dp -->|No| am --> ar --> ac --> as --> lg2
as --> wr --> g2
am --> cx
